                },
                "title": "Lagos Average Delivery Time \u2014 Week over Week",
                "alt_text": "Line graph showing Lagos average delivery time rising from 28 min in Wk 1 to 38 min in Wk 8, illustrating a week-over-week trend.",
                "encoding": {
                  "x": {
                    "field": "week_label",
                    "type": "ordinal",
                    "title": "Week"
                  },
                  "y": {
                    "field": "avg_delivery_minutes",
                    "type": "quantitative",
                    "title": "Avg Delivery Time (min)"
                  }
                }
              },
              "takeaway": "The same delivery data supports both charts \u2014 the bar chart makes a comparison point (which city is slowest?), the line graph makes a trend point (is Lagos getting slower?). Choose the chart that matches the point you are making.",
              "lineage": {
