              },
              "change_summary": "Border removed \u2014 white space does the job of separation. Gridlines removed \u2014 the axis scale is sufficient. Trailing zeros dropped from axis labels (34.00 \u2192 34). City-name tick labels un-rotated \u2014 short names read fine horizontally. Per-bar data labels removed \u2014 the axis gives approximate values. None of these changes alter the underlying delivery-time numbers.",
