              "type": "prose",
              "block_id": "tile_stakeholder_chart_matching_simplifying.r03.b2",
              "role": "takeaway",
              "text": "Reducing clutter lets the audience use their attention to decide what actions might be warranted, rather than working out how to read the graph. None of these removals change the underlying delivery-time numbers.",
